# Into the Beast's Maw (WotG 33) at Status 1 (a GM): the login plays no zone-in event. At Status 3 without the flare (a
# GM) the Ornate Block plays nothing of the mission's (its DefaultActions NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY, 6409), and the
# Peculiar Glint neither (its DefaultActions NO_RESPONSE, 7905). At Status 2 (a GM) the zone-in plays 14; the update
# with option 4 sends no 05C; the finish sets Status 3, and the next tick shows the set-down (the 00B zone-out, the char
# at 183.405 -24.041 100.041 rot 126). The login plays 15; its finish gives the flare and sets Status 4.
lists XarcabardS/Rally_Point_Red/onTrigger CastleZvahlBaileysS/Ornate_Block/onTrigger CastleZvahlBaileysS/Peculiar_Glint/onTrigger CastleZvahlBaileysS/onZoneIn/1 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventUpdate/14 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/1 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/2 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/3 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/11 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/14 CastleZvahlBaileysS/onEventFinish/15
char zone=CastleZvahlBaileysS pos=179.4,-24.1,98 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg IntoTheBeastsMaw current
charvar Mission[5][32]Status 1
login                                      # Status 1: no zone-in event
charvar Mission[5][32]Status 3
trigger Ornate_Block                       # Status 3, no flare: not the mission's
finish-if-event
trigger Peculiar_Glint                     # Status 3: not the mission's
finish-if-event
charvar Mission[5][32]Status 2
rezone open                                # 14
update 14 option=4                         # not 5: no packet
finish                                     # Status 3, set down
tick 400
login open                                 # 15
finish                                     # the flare, Status 4
